    "```text NUMBER        VARIABLE QUANTITY 00000000              00 00000040              40 0000007F              7F 00000080             81 00 00002000             C0 00 00003FFF             FF 7F 00004000           81 80 00 00100000           C0 80 00 001FFFFF           FF FF 7F 00200000          81 80 80 00 08000000          C0 80 80 00 0FFFFFFF          FF FF FF 7F ```",
    "[vlq]: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Variable-length_quantity"
  ],
